Template: homelab-search/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.

Template: homelab-search/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-search/mail_root
Type: string
Default: /srv/mail-ro
Description: Read-only mount of the dovecot mail store:
 Must be exported read-only by the NAS as well, not merely mounted -o ro.
 See install-orchestrators/search-hosts-nfs.sh.

Template: homelab-search/drive_root
Type: string
Default: /srv/drive-ro
Description: Read-only mount of the drive blob store:
 Blobs are stored flat by uuid, so this directory is never enumerated --
 a blob is only opened for a uuid an account-scoped query returned.

Template: homelab-search/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2517
Description: Port the search web app will listen on:
 Phase 2. The indexer itself listens on nothing.
